@AuthSandbox_HostAddress = http://localhost:5255

### 1. Health
GET {{AuthSandbox_HostAddress}}/api/sandbox/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Basic Auth - Secure Data
GET {{AuthSandbox_HostAddress}}/api/BasicAuth/secure-data
Authorization: Basic c2FuZGJveC11c2VyOnNhbmRib3gtcGFzcw==
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Basic Auth - Test 2
GET {{AuthSandbox_HostAddress}}/api/BasicAuth/test-2
Authorization: Basic c2FuZGJveC11c2VyOnNhbmRib3gtcGFzcw==
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Healthcare - Register Patient (without optional email)
POST {{AuthSandbox_HostAddress}}/api/sandbox/healthcare/patients
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alex Smith",
  "dateOfBirth": "1988-11-23",
  "insuranceProvider": "BlueShield",
  "policyNumber": "POL-99201"
}

###

### 5. Healthcare - Register Patient (with email provided or null)
POST {{AuthSandbox_HostAddress}}/api/sandbox/healthcare/patients
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alex Smith",
  "dateOfBirth": "1988-11-23",
  "insuranceProvider": "BlueShield",
  "policyNumber": "POL-99201",
  "email": "alex.smith@example.com"
}

###
